## Pre-existing failures (not of this branch)

`Test_org_eclipse_swt_widgets_CoolItem`: `test_getBounds`, `test_setSizeII` and `test_setControlLorg_eclipse_swt_widgets_Control`
fail identically with the official SWT 3.135.0 jar on the hidden desktop (`coolitem-official.log`: 21 successful,
3 failed), in the default and in the original mode: a band of a CoolBar that was never given a size keeps an 11 pixel
width. They are not caused by the CoolBar viewport.
